</head><body> <a href="#top"> <button>Retour en haut</button> </a> <header> <nav class="container-fluid mobile"> <ul> <li class="centerText title"> <img class="logo" src="https://cdn2.steamgriddb.com/logo_thumb/0abe10cc20cfedb109fd9cee834adc18.png" alt="undefined"><span>MACROS DE STRATAGÈMES</span> </li> </ul> <ul class="mobileCenter"> <li><a href="#about"> À propos </a></li> <li><a href="#install"> Installer </a></li> <li><a href="#usage"> Usage </a></li> <li>  <details class="dropdown"> <summary>Français</summary><ul><li><a href="https://NicholasDJM.github.io/Helldivers%202%20Stratagem%20Macros/en-CA.html">English</a></li><li><a href="https://NicholasDJM.github.io/Helldivers%202%20Stratagem%20Macros/fr-CA.html">Français</a></li></ul> </details> </li> </ul> </nav> </header> <main class="container-fluid"> <article id="about"> <section> <h1>À propos des macros de stratagème HELLDIVERS™ 2</h1> <div class="grid"> <div style="display:none!important">  <video controls controlslist="nodownload"> <source src="./videos/fr-CA/about.dark.webm" type="video/webm" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)"> <source src="./videos/fr-CA/about.light.webm" type="video/webm"> </video> </div> <div> <p>HELLDIVERS™ 2 Stratagem Macros is an AutoHotkey macro script, that will automatically input the correct sequence of keys to call in a stratagem.</p><p>The script will read the correct keys for each Steam user, requiring zero manual configuration.</p><p>You can execute these macros either through your own AutoHotkey scripts, or through Elgato Stream Deck.</p> </div> </div> </section> </article> <article id="install"> <section> <h2>Comment installer les macros Stratagem</h2> <ol> <li>Ensure you have the latest version of Windows 10 or Windows 11. Specifically, Windows 10 22H2 or later.</li> <li>Ensure <a href="https://www.autohotkey.com" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"> AutoHotkey 2</a> or later is installed.</li> <li>Download my <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NicholasDJM/Helldivers-2-Stratagem-Macros/main/Helldivers%202%20Macros.ahk" download="Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">macro script</a> to it's own folder. (Right click on the link, and select "Save Link as")</li> </ol><p>Please note: the script can overwrite files named <code>version.txt</code>, <code>options.toml</code>, <code>play.ahk</code>, <code>Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk.tar.gz</code>, and <code>Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk</code>. Make sure not to save anything with those names.</p> </section> <section> <h3>Syntax</h3> <p>Text surrounded in <code>&lt;angled brackets&gt;</code> are required, while text surrounded in <code>[square brackets]</code> are optional. Text surrounded in quotes is to be typed out verbatim. Any of the options can be set in any order. If an option contains spaces, you must surround it with quotation marks.</p><code>"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" &lt;Stratagem Name&gt; ["update macros"] ["generate options.toml"] [delay] [holdDelay] [path] [wait]</code><ul> <li><code>Stratagem Name</code> - This is the name of a stratagem you wish to use. See the Stratagem list below.</li> <li><code>"update macros"</code> - Enter this verbatim to run the auto updater.</li> <li><code>"generate options.toml"</code> - Enter this verbatim to generate an options.toml file with the default options.</li> <li><code>delay</code> - This controls the timing between keystrokes, in milliseconds. Type out <code>delay=x</code>, but replace x with a number. Default is 250.</li> <li><code>holdDelay</code> - This controls the timing between the key down and key up events, in milliseconds. Type out <code>holdDelay=x</code>, but replace x with a number. Default is 10.</li> <li><code>path</code> - This sets the path to your Steam installation. Type out <code>path=x</code>, but replace x with a path. Default is "C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam".</li> <li><code>updates</code> - Set this to false, if you want to disable automatic checks for new updates. Type out <code>updates=false</code>. Default is true.</li> <li><code>wait</code> - This delays calling in a stratagem, in milliseconds. Type out <code>wait=x</code>, but replace x with a number. Default is 0.</li> </ul><p>Execute <code>Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk</code> without any arguments to open this instruction manual.</p> </section> <section> <h3>Examples</h3> <ul> <li>Call in the Patriot Exosuit: <code>"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" "patriot exosuit"</code></li> <li>Call in the Autocannon with a key delay of 250 milliseconds: <code>"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" autocannon delay=500</code></li> <li>Call in the Recoilless Rifle with a key hold delay of 50 milliseconds: <code>"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" "recoilless rifle" holdDelay=500</code></li> <li>Call in the Eagle 500kg Bomb, with the path to Steam on drive D: <code>"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk" "eagle 500kg bomb" "steamPath=D:\Steam"</code></li> </ul> </section> </article> <article id="usage"> <section> <h2>How to use Stratagem Macros</h2> <details id="deck-howto"> <summary>Using with Elgato Stream Deck</summary> <div class="grid"> <div> <ol> <li>Open the Elgato Stream Deck software.</li> <li>Ensure <a href="https://marketplace.elgato.com/product/advanced-launcher-d9a289e4-9f61-4613-9f86-0069f5897125" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">BarRaiders's Advanced Launcher</a> plugin is installed.</li> <li>Add "Advanced Launcher" action to a button.</li> <li>In the action's settings, click on "Choose file...", and select the macro script.</li> <li>In the "Arguments" text field, add your desired stratagem, in quotes.</li> </ol><p>Please note: You cannot use the standard "Open" action, as it does not allow for specifying arguments, which is required by the script.</p> </div> <div class="center"> <img alt="undefined" height="299px" width="569px" src="images/fr-CA/ExampleUsageWithStreamDeck.webp"> </div> </div> </details> <hr> <details id="ahk-howto"> <summary>Using with AutoHotkey</summary> <div class="grid"> <div> <p>This example <abbr title="AutoHotkey">AHK</abbr> script allows you to call your favourite stratagem. In this case, mine is the Recoilless Rifle, and the Patriot Exosuit. You can modify it as you see fit. This particular script will call in the Recoilless Rifle on <kbd>Mouse 4</kbd>, the Patriot Exosuit on <kbd>Mouse 5</kbd>, and the Hellbomb on the <kbd>H</kbd> key.</p><p>Once this script is saved somewhere, double click on it in Explorer to start the script. AutoHotkey will now listen for the buttons listed in the script.</p><p>Look at <a href="https://www.autohotkey.com/docs/v2/KeyList.htm" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">AutoHotkey's key list</a> for a complete list of keys that can be bound.</p> </div> <div> <h3>Example AutoHotkey Script</h3> <pre><code id="ahkExample" class="language-autohotkey" data-filename="example.ahk" data-mime="application/ahk" dir="ltr"><span class="token directive important">#Requires</span> AutoHotkey <span class="token operator">>=</span><span class="token number">2.0</span>
<span class="token command selector">SendMode</span> <span class="token string">"Event"</span>
<span class="token command selector">SetWorkingDir</span> <span class="token constant">A_ScriptDir</span>
<span class="token function">macro</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>stratagem<span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>
	<span class="token keyword">if</span> <span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token builtin">WinActive</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"HELLDIVERS™ 2"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>
		<span class="token keyword">try</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>
			<span class="token command selector">Run</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span>'<span class="token string">"Helldivers 2 Macros.ahk"</span> <span class="token string">"' . stratagem . '"</span>'<span class="token punctuation">)</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span> <span class="token keyword">catch</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span>
			<span class="token command selector">TrayTip</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"Could not run Helldivers 2 Macros script."</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
		<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
	<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
<span class="token symbol">XButton1</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token comment">; Mouse Browser Back button</span>
	<span class="token function">macro</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"recoilless rifle"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
<span class="token symbol">XButton2</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">{</span> <span class="token comment">; Mouse Browser Forward button</span>
	<span class="token function">macro</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token string">"patriot exosuit"</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span>
<span class="token punctuation">}</span>
