<span class="token key property">wait</span> <span class="token punctuation">=</span> <span class="token number">1000</span> <span class="token comment"># Default 0</span></code></pre> <div class="justifyEnd"> <a href="data:application/toml;base64,ZGVsYXkgPSAyNTAgIyBEZWZhdWx0IDE1MA0KaG9sZERlbGF5ID0gNTAgIyBEZWZhdWx0IDEwDQpzdGVhbVBhdGggPSAiRDpcXFN0ZWFtIiAjIERlZmF1bHQgIkM6XFByb2dyYW0gRmlsZXMgKHg4NilcU3RlYW0iDQp1cGRhdGVzID0gZmFsc2UgIyBEZWZhdWx0IGlzIHRydWUNCndhaXQgPSAxMDAwICMgRGVmYXVsdCAw"><button> Télécharger </button></a> </div> </div> </div> </details> </section> </article> </main> </body></html>
